{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_27_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_27","textTraditional":"一、十有六年，春，正月，公會宋公、蔡侯、衞侯於曹。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_27_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_27","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，公會宋公、衞侯、陳侯、蔡侯伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_27_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_27","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月，公至自伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_27_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_27","textTraditional":"桓無會，其致何也？危之也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_27_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_27","textTraditional":"四、冬，城向。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_27_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_27","textTraditional":"五、十有一月，衞侯朔出奔齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_27_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_27","textTraditional":"朔之名，惡也。天子召而不往也。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}